  "limits": [
    "Byte/ACK timing, no electrical waveforms, arbitration or clock stretching.",
    "Callbacks observe the enclosing bus tick; existing scheduler granularity still applies. Direct callers must advance time and honor next_deadline for precise callback timestamps.",
    "The fixture uses 10 kHz to isolate bus time from Arduino delay(1) returning before a full millisecond; 100 kHz strict sensor reads remain an application timing limitation.",
    "Test-only SCD4x protocol subset; SEN66 and MLX90393 private device models not run. Classic has MMIO timing coverage, no Arduino sensor firmware.",
